  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d8e9c4ee2d087d04d9b8cdf89c4f21bd, type: 3}
  m_Name: Lore3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_2
  title: Day Three
  fullText: 'Every night, a single lantern drifts between the graves.


    No one
    has ever seen the person carrying it.


    People who follow the light are found
    the next morning standing beside a grave with their own name carved into the
    stone.


    The villagers warn travelers never to chase the lantern.


    Because
    the Keeper does not guide the lost.


    He guides the dead.'
